{"seq":1,"slug":"context-patterns","title":"Context 模式","url":"/l-doc-books/h/frontend/react-in-depth/state-management/context-patterns","wordCount":553,"readingTime":3,"html":"<h1 id=\"context-模式\">Context 模式</h1><h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>React Context 由 <code>createContext</code>、<code>Provider</code> 和 <code>useContext</code> 三部分组成，提供了一条跨组件树传递数据的通道，免去逐层手动传递 props 的麻烦。但 Context 的值变化会让所有消费者重渲染，因此它的核心难点在于「如何拆分与稳定 Provider value」。本章讲解基础用法、Provider 组合函数、按领域拆分 Context 而非使用巨型 Context、引用稳定性与状态派发分离两类性能陷阱，以及 <code>use-context-selector</code> 带来的细粒度订阅。</p>\n<h2 id=\"context-基础\">Context 基础</h2><p>React Context 提供了一种跨组件树传递数据的方式，无需通过每一层手动传递 props。它由 <code>createContext</code>、<code>Provider</code> 和 <code>useContext</code> 三部分组成。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"tsx\" data-code=\"interface ThemeContextValue {&#10;  theme: &#39;light&#39; | &#39;dark&#39;;&#10;  toggleTheme: () =&gt; void;&#10;}&#10;&#10;const ThemeContext = createContext&lt;ThemeContextValue | null&gt;(null);&#10;&#10;function ThemeProvider({ children }: { children: React.ReactNode }) {&#10;  const [theme, setTheme] = useState&lt;&#39;light&#39; | &#39;dark&#39;&gt;(&#39;light&#39;);&#10;&#10;  const value = useMemo&lt;ThemeContextValue&gt;(&#10;    () =&gt; ({&#10;      theme,&#10;      toggleTheme: () =&gt; setTheme((t) =&gt; (t === &#39;light&#39; ? &#39;dark&#39; : &#39;light&#39;)),&#10;    }),&#10;    [theme],&#10;  );&#10;&#10;  return &lt;ThemeContext.Provider value={value}&gt;{children}&lt;/ThemeContext.Provider&gt;;&#10;}&#10;&#10;function useTheme(): ThemeContextValue {&#10;  const context = useContext(ThemeContext);&#10;  if (context === null) {&#10;    throw new Error(&#39;useTheme must be used within ThemeProvider&#39;);&#10;  }&#10;  return context;&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>interface ThemeContextValue {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  theme: 'light' | 'dark';</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  toggleTheme: () => void;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>const ThemeContext = createContext&#x3C;ThemeContextValue | null>(null);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>function ThemeProvider({ children }: { children: React.ReactNode }) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  const [theme, setTheme] = useState&#x3C;'light' | 'dark'>('light');</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  const value = useMemo&#x3C;ThemeContextValue>(</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    () => ({</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>      theme,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>      toggleTheme: () => setTheme((t) => (t === 'light' ? 'dark' : 'light')),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    }),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    [theme],</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  );</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  return &#x3C;ThemeContext.Provider value={value}>{children}&#x3C;/ThemeContext.Provider>;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>function useTheme(): ThemeContextValue {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  const context = useContext(ThemeContext);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  if (context === null) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    throw new Error('useTheme must be used within ThemeProvider');</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  return context;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span></code></pre></div><pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;    A[&quot;ThemeProvider (value)&quot;] --&gt; B[Layout]&#10;    B --&gt; C[Header]&#10;    B --&gt; D[Main]&#10;    B --&gt; E[Footer]&#10;    C --&gt; F[&quot;useTheme() → 获取 value&quot;]&#10;    D --&gt; G[&quot;useTheme() → 获取 value&quot;]&#10;    E --&gt; H[&quot;useTheme() → 获取 value&quot;]\">flowchart TD\n    A[\"ThemeProvider (value)\"] --&gt; B[Layout]\n    B --&gt; C[Header]\n    B --&gt; D[Main]\n    B --&gt; E[Footer]\n    C --&gt; F[\"useTheme() → 获取 value\"]\n    D --&gt; G[\"useTheme() → 获取 value\"]\n    E --&gt; H[\"useTheme() → 获取 value\"]</pre><hr>\n<h2 id=\"provider-组合\">Provider 组合</h2><p>当应用需要多个 Context 时，Provider 嵌套会变得很深。可以通过组合模式简化：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"tsx\" data-code=\"function AppProviders({ children }: { children: React.ReactNode }) {&#10;  return (&#10;    &lt;ThemeProvider&gt;&#10;      &lt;AuthProvider&gt;&#10;        &lt;I18nProvider&gt;&#10;          &lt;NotificationProvider&gt;{children}&lt;/NotificationProvider&gt;&#10;        &lt;/I18nProvider&gt;&#10;      &lt;/AuthProvider&gt;&#10;    &lt;/ThemeProvider&gt;&#10;  );&#10;}&#10;&#10;function composeProviders(&#10;  ...providers: Array&lt;React.FC&lt;{ children: React.ReactNode }&gt;&gt;&#10;): React.FC&lt;{ children: React.ReactNode }&gt; {&#10;  return providers.reduce(&#10;    (Accumulated, Current) =&gt;&#10;      function ComposedProvider({ children }) {&#10;        return (&#10;          &lt;Accumulated&gt;&#10;            &lt;Current&gt;{children}&lt;/Current&gt;&#10;          &lt;/Accumulated&gt;&#10;        );&#10;      },&#10;    ({ children }: { children: React.ReactNode }) =&gt; &lt;&gt;{children}&lt;/&gt;,&#10;  );&#10;}&#10;&#10;const AppProviders2 = composeProviders(ThemeProvider, AuthProvider, I18nProvider, NotificationProvider);\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>function AppProviders({ children }: { children: React.ReactNode }) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  return (</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    &#x3C;ThemeProvider></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>      &#x3C;AuthProvider></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        &#x3C;I18nProvider></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>          &#x3C;NotificationProvider>{children}&#x3C;/NotificationProvider></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        &#x3C;/I18nProvider></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>      &#x3C;/AuthProvider></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    &#x3C;/ThemeProvider></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  );</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>function composeProviders(</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  ...providers: Array&#x3C;React.FC&#x3C;{ children: React.ReactNode }>></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>): React.FC&#x3C;{ children: React.ReactNode }> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  return providers.reduce(</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    (Accumulated, Current) =></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>      function ComposedProvider({ children }) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        return (</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>          &#x3C;Accumulated></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            &#x3C;Current>{children}&#x3C;/Current></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>          &#x3C;/Accumulated></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        );</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>      },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    ({ children }: { children: React.ReactNode }) => &#x3C;>{children}&#x3C;/>,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  );</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>const AppProviders2 = composeProviders(ThemeProvider, AuthProvider, I18nProvider, NotificationProvider);</span></span></code></pre></div><hr>\n<h2 id=\"context-拆分\">Context 拆分</h2><p>将不相关的状态放在同一个 Context 中会导致不必要的重渲染。<strong>Context 拆分</strong>是核心优化策略：</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;    subgraph 问题&#10;        A[&quot;AppContext (user + theme + locale)&quot;]&#10;        A --&gt; B[&quot;任何值变化 → 所有消费者重渲染&quot;]&#10;    end&#10;    subgraph 解决&#10;        C[&quot;UserContext&quot;]&#10;        D[&quot;ThemeContext&quot;]&#10;        E[&quot;LocaleContext&quot;]&#10;        C --&gt; F[&quot;只有 user 变化时重渲染&quot;]&#10;        D --&gt; G[&quot;只有 theme 变化时重渲染&quot;]&#10;        E --&gt; H[&quot;只有 locale 变化时重渲染&quot;]&#10;    end\">flowchart TD\n    subgraph 问题\n        A[\"AppContext (user + theme + locale)\"]\n        A --&gt; B[\"任何值变化 → 所有消费者重渲染\"]\n    end\n    subgraph 解决\n        C[\"UserContext\"]\n        D[\"ThemeContext\"]\n        E[\"LocaleContext\"]\n        C --&gt; F[\"只有 user 变化时重渲染\"]\n        D --&gt; G[\"只有 theme 变化时重渲染\"]\n        E --&gt; H[\"只有 locale 变化时重渲染\"]\n    end</pre><h3 id=\"反模式-巨型-context\">反模式：巨型 Context</h3><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"tsx\" data-code=\"interface AppState {&#10;  user: User | null;&#10;  theme: &#39;light&#39; | &#39;dark&#39;;&#10;  locale: string;&#10;  notifications: Notification[];&#10;}&#10;&#10;const AppContext = createContext&lt;AppState &amp; AppActions&gt;(/* ... */);\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>interface AppState {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  user: User | null;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  theme: 'light' | 'dark';</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  locale: string;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  notifications: Notification[];</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>const AppContext = createContext&#x3C;AppState &#x26; AppActions>(/* ... */);</span></span></code></pre></div><h3 id=\"正确模式-按领域拆分\">正确模式：按领域拆分</h3><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"tsx\" data-code=\"const UserContext = createContext&lt;UserContextValue | null&gt;(null);&#10;const ThemeContext = createContext&lt;ThemeContextValue | null&gt;(null);&#10;const LocaleContext = createContext&lt;LocaleContextValue | null&gt;(null);\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>const UserContext = createContext&#x3C;UserContextValue | null>(null);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>const ThemeContext = createContext&#x3C;ThemeContextValue | null>(null);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>const LocaleContext = createContext&#x3C;LocaleContextValue | null>(null);</span></span></code></pre></div><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>策略</th>\n<th>重渲染范围</th>\n<th>维护成本</th>\n<th>适用场景</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>单一 Context</td>\n<td>所有消费者</td>\n<td>低</td>\n<td>简单应用</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>按领域拆分</td>\n<td>仅相关消费者</td>\n<td>中</td>\n<td>中型应用</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>状态/派发分离</td>\n<td>最小范围</td>\n<td>稍高</td>\n<td>频繁更新场景</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"性能陷阱\">性能陷阱</h2><h3 id=\"陷阱-1-provider-value-的引用稳定性\">陷阱 1：Provider value 的引用稳定性</h3><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"tsx\" data-code=\"function BadProvider({ children }: { children: React.ReactNode }) {&#10;  const [count, setCount] = useState(0);&#10;&#10;  return &lt;MyContext.Provider value={{ count, increment: () =&gt; setCount((c) =&gt; c + 1) }}&gt;{children}&lt;/MyContext.Provider&gt;;&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>function BadProvider({ children }: { children: React.ReactNode }) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  const [count, setCount] = useState(0);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  return &#x3C;MyContext.Provider value={{ count, increment: () => setCount((c) => c + 1) }}>{children}&#x3C;/MyContext.Provider>;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span></code></pre></div><p>每次 <code>BadProvider</code> 渲染时，<code>value</code> 都是新对象，导致所有消费者重渲染。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"tsx\" data-code=\"function GoodProvider({ children }: { children: React.ReactNode }) {&#10;  const [count, setCount] = useState(0);&#10;&#10;  const value = useMemo(() =&gt; ({ count, increment: () =&gt; setCount((c) =&gt; c + 1) }), [count]);&#10;&#10;  return &lt;MyContext.Provider value={value}&gt;{children}&lt;/MyContext.Provider&gt;;&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>function GoodProvider({ children }: { children: React.ReactNode }) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  const [count, setCount] = useState(0);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  const value = useMemo(() => ({ count, increment: () => setCount((c) => c + 1) }), [count]);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  return &#x3C;MyContext.Provider value={value}>{children}&#x3C;/MyContext.Provider>;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span></code></pre></div><h3 id=\"陷阱-2-状态与派发不分离\">陷阱 2：状态与派发不分离</h3><p>当只需要 dispatch 的组件也订阅了 state Context，state 变化会触发不必要渲染：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"tsx\" data-code=\"const StateContext = createContext&lt;AppState&gt;(initialState);&#10;const DispatchContext = createContext&lt;React.Dispatch&lt;Action&gt;&gt;(() =&gt; {});&#10;&#10;function AppProvider({ children }: { children: React.ReactNode }) {&#10;  const [state, dispatch] = useReducer(appReducer, initialState);&#10;&#10;  return (&#10;    &lt;StateContext.Provider value={state}&gt;&#10;      &lt;DispatchContext.Provider value={dispatch}&gt;{children}&lt;/DispatchContext.Provider&gt;&#10;    &lt;/StateContext.Provider&gt;&#10;  );&#10;}&#10;&#10;function ActionButton() {&#10;  const dispatch = useContext(DispatchContext);&#10;  return &lt;button onClick={() =&gt; dispatch({ type: &#39;INCREMENT&#39; })}&gt;+1&lt;/button&gt;;&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>const StateContext = createContext&#x3C;AppState>(initialState);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>const DispatchContext = createContext&#x3C;React.Dispatch&#x3C;Action>>(() => {});</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>function AppProvider({ children }: { children: React.ReactNode }) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  const [state, dispatch] = useReducer(appReducer, initialState);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  return (</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    &#x3C;StateContext.Provider value={state}></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>      &#x3C;DispatchContext.Provider value={dispatch}>{children}&#x3C;/DispatchContext.Provider></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    &#x3C;/StateContext.Provider></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  );</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>function ActionButton() {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  const dispatch = useContext(DispatchContext);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  return &#x3C;button onClick={() => dispatch({ type: 'INCREMENT' })}>+1&#x3C;/button>;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span></code></pre></div><blockquote>\n<p><strong>提示：</strong> <code>dispatch</code> 函数在组件生命周期内引用稳定（React 保证），因此 <code>DispatchContext</code> 的 value 不会变化，使用 dispatch 的组件不会因 state 变更而重渲染。</p>\n</blockquote>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"context-selectors\">Context Selectors</h2><p>React 原生不支持 Context Selector（只消费 Context 的部分值）。社区有 <code>use-context-selector</code> 库提供此能力：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"tsx\" data-code=\"import { createContext, useContextSelector } from &#39;use-context-selector&#39;;&#10;&#10;interface Store {&#10;  count: number;&#10;  text: string;&#10;  increment: () =&gt; void;&#10;  setText: (text: string) =&gt; void;&#10;}&#10;&#10;const StoreContext = createContext&lt;Store&gt;(null!);&#10;&#10;function CountDisplay() {&#10;  const count = useContextSelector(StoreContext, (s) =&gt; s.count);&#10;  return &lt;span&gt;{count}&lt;/span&gt;;&#10;}&#10;&#10;function TextDisplay() {&#10;  const text = useContextSelector(StoreContext, (s) =&gt; s.text);&#10;  return &lt;span&gt;{text}&lt;/span&gt;;&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>import { createContext, useContextSelector } from 'use-context-selector';</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>interface Store {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  count: number;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  text: string;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  increment: () => void;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  setText: (text: string) => void;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>const StoreContext = createContext&#x3C;Store>(null!);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>function CountDisplay() {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  const count = useContextSelector(StoreContext, (s) => s.count);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  return &#x3C;span>{count}&#x3C;/span>;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>function TextDisplay() {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  const text = useContextSelector(StoreContext, (s) => s.text);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  return &#x3C;span>{text}&#x3C;/span>;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span></code></pre></div><pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;    A[&quot;StoreContext (count=5, text=&#39;hello&#39;)&quot;]&#10;    A --&gt; B[&quot;CountDisplay: 只订阅 count&quot;]&#10;    A --&gt; C[&quot;TextDisplay: 只订阅 text&quot;]&#10;&#10;    D[&quot;count 变化&quot;] --&gt; B&#10;    D -. 不影响 .-&gt; C&#10;    E[&quot;text 变化&quot;] --&gt; C&#10;    E -. 不影响 .-&gt; B\">flowchart TD\n    A[\"StoreContext (count=5, text='hello')\"]\n    A --&gt; B[\"CountDisplay: 只订阅 count\"]\n    A --&gt; C[\"TextDisplay: 只订阅 text\"]\n\n    D[\"count 变化\"] --&gt; B\n    D -. 不影响 .-&gt; C\n    E[\"text 变化\"] --&gt; C\n    E -. 不影响 .-&gt; B</pre><hr>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>Context 通过 Provider/Consumer 模式跨组件传递数据，避免 props drilling</li>\n<li>多个 Provider 可以通过<strong>组合函数</strong>简化嵌套</li>\n<li>将不相关的状态拆分到不同 Context 中，减少不必要的重渲染</li>\n<li>Provider value 必须保持引用稳定（使用 <code>useMemo</code>），state 和 dispatch 应分离到不同 Context</li>\n<li>使用 <code>use-context-selector</code> 库可以实现细粒度的 Context 订阅</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"Context 模式","id":"context-模式"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"Context 基础","id":"context-基础"},{"level":2,"text":"Provider 组合","id":"provider-组合"},{"level":2,"text":"Context 拆分","id":"context-拆分"},{"level":3,"text":"反模式：巨型 Context","id":"反模式-巨型-context"},{"level":3,"text":"正确模式：按领域拆分","id":"正确模式-按领域拆分"},{"level":2,"text":"性能陷阱","id":"性能陷阱"},{"level":3,"text":"陷阱 1：Provider value 的引用稳定性","id":"陷阱-1-provider-value-的引用稳定性"},{"level":3,"text":"陷阱 2：状态与派发不分离","id":"陷阱-2-状态与派发不分离"},{"level":2,"text":"Context Selectors","id":"context-selectors"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"useRef 与命令式","url":"/l-doc-books/h/frontend/react-in-depth/hooks-mastery/use-ref-and-imperative"},"next":{"title":"Zustand 状态管理","url":"/l-doc-books/h/frontend/react-in-depth/state-management/zustand"}}